# Tailwind CSS 스타일링 가이드

## 컬러 시스템

### Primary Colors (네온 블루)
```html
<!-- 텍스트 -->
<h1 class="text-cyan-400">Title</h1>

<!-- 배경 -->
<div class="bg-cyan-500">Button</div>

<!-- 테두리 -->
<div class="border border-cyan-500">Card</div>

<!-- 그림자 -->
<div class="shadow-xl shadow-cyan-500/20">Card</div>
```

### Background Colors
```html
<!-- 메인 배경 -->
<body class="bg-gray-950">

<!-- 섹션 배경 -->
<section class="bg-gray-900">

<!-- 카드 배경 (글래스모피즘) -->
<div class="bg-gray-900/50 backdrop-blur-sm">
```

## 타이포그래피

### 폰트 크기
```html
<!-- Hero Title -->
<h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold">Your Name</h1>

<!-- Section Title -->
<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold">About Me</h2>

<!-- Body Text -->
<p class="text-base md:text-lg">Description...</p>

<!-- Caption -->
<span class="text-sm text-gray-400">2020 - 2025</span>
```

### 폰트 굵기
```html
<h1 class="font-bold">제목</h1>        <!-- 700 -->
<h2 class="font-semibold">소제목</h2>   <!-- 600 -->
<p class="font-normal">본문</p>         <!-- 400 -->
<span class="font-light">캡션</span>    <!-- 300 -->
```

## 간격 시스템

### Padding
```html
<div class="p-4">1rem (16px)</div>
<div class="p-6">1.5rem (24px)</div>
<div class="p-8">2rem (32px)</div>
<div class="p-12">3rem (48px)</div>
```

### Margin
```html
<section class="py-24">섹션 간격</section>
<div class="mb-8">요소 간격</div>
```

## 컴포넌트 스타일

### 버튼
```html
<!-- Primary Button -->
<button class="px-6 py-3 bg-cyan-500 hover:bg-cyan-400 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-cyan-500/50">
  Click Me
</button>

<!-- Ghost Button -->
<button class="px-6 py-3 border-2 border-cyan-500 text-cyan-500 hover:bg-cyan-500/10 font-semibold rounded-lg transition-all duration-300">
  Learn More
</button>
```

### 카드
```html
<div class="bg-gray-900/50 backdrop-blur-sm border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-cyan-500/20 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2">
  <!-- Card Content -->
</div>
```

### 입력 필드
```html
<input 
  type="text" 
  class="w-full bg-gray-900 border border-gray-700 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-white placeholder-gray-500 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-cyan-500/20 transition-colors"
  placeholder="your@email.com"
>
```

## 애니메이션

### Transition
```html
<!-- Fast -->
<div class="transition-all duration-150">Fast transition</div>

<!-- Normal -->
<div class="transition-all duration-300">Normal transition</div>

<!-- Slow -->
<div class="transition-all duration-700">Slow transition</div>
```

### Hover 효과
```html
<!-- Scale -->
<div class="hover:scale-105 transition-transform">Hover me</div>

<!-- Shadow -->
<div class="hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-cyan-500/30 transition-shadow">Hover me</div>

<!-- Translate -->
<div class="hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform">Hover me</div>
```

### 스크롤 애니메이션
```html
<!-- Fade In Up -->
<div class="opacity-0 translate-y-12 transition-all duration-700 data-[visible=true]:opacity-100 data-[visible=true]:translate-y-0">
  Content
</div>
```

## 반응형 디자인

### Breakpoints
```html
<!-- 모바일 우선 -->
<div class="text-base md:text-lg lg:text-xl">
  Responsive text
</div>

<!-- Grid -->
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
  <!-- Cards -->
</div>

<!-- 숨김/표시 -->
<div class="block md:hidden">모바일만 보임</div>
<div class="hidden md:block">데스크톱만 보임</div>
```

## 글래스모피즘 효과
```html
<div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-lg border border-white/20 rounded-2xl p-6">
  <!-- 유리 같은 효과 -->
</div>
```

## 다크 모드 (기본)
```html
<!-- 배경 -->
<body class="bg-gray-950 text-white">

<!-- 섹션 -->
<section class="bg-gray-900">

<!-- 카드 -->
<div class="bg-gray-800/50">
```

## 필수 클래스 조합
```html
<!-- Section Container -->
<section class="py-24 px-4 md:px-8 lg:px-16 max-w-7xl mx-auto">

<!-- Card -->
<div class="bg-gray-900/50 backdrop-blur-sm border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-cyan-500/20 transition-all duration-300">

<!-- Button -->
<button class="px-6 py-3 bg-cyan-500 hover:bg-cyan-400 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105">
```
```

